OL,4,CVital scans missed 'due to shocking    
OL,5,Cpost delays'                           
OL,6,GPeople are missing out on crucial      
OL,7,Gcancer scans, medical appointments and 
OL,8,Gimportant bills because of "shocking"  
OL,9,Gpostal delays, an MP has said.         
OL,11,FLabour's Jonathan Brash said some      
OL,12,Fpeople in his area of Hartlepool had   
OL,13,Fgone weeks without a delivery to their 
OL,14,Fhomes and he described Royal Mail's    
OL,15,Fslow service as "a complete and utter" 
OL,16,Fdisaster.                              
OL,18,FHe was one of 70 MPs to question the   
OL,19,Fcompany's chief executive in           
OL,20,FParliament last week about "persistent 
OL,21,Ffailures" with the service.            
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
