OL,4,CSeal population 'may be reaching       
OL,5,Cnatural plateau'                       
OL,6,GThe grey seal population at one of the 
OL,7,Glargest colonies in England may have   
OL,8,Greached a natural plateau, a wildlife  
OL,9,Granger said.                           
OL,11,FIt comes as the National Trust, which  
OL,12,Fmanages the Farne Islands off the      
OL,13,FNorthumberland coast, begins the       
OL,14,Fannual census to monitor the mammals'  
OL,15,Fnumbers and health.                    
OL,17,FIn the 2025 breeding season, 3,385     
OL,18,Fgrey seal pups were recorded on the    
OL,19,Fislands, a 6.6% reduction from 2024.   
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
