OL,4,CBrain implant centre gets #6m funding  
OL,5,Cto grow                                
OL,6,GThe UK's first centre dedicated to     
OL,7,Gadvancing pioneering brain implant     
OL,8,Gtechnology has secured more than #6m   
OL,9,Gto expand treatments.                  
OL,11,FThe National Centre for                
OL,12,FNeurotechnology and Neurorestoration   
OL,13,F(NCNN) in Newcastle uses brain and     
OL,14,Fnervous system technologies to help    
OL,15,Ftreat patients with conditions         
OL,16,Fincluding Parkinson's disease,         
OL,17,Fparalysis and severe pain.             
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
