OL,4,CCouncil proposes 26% cut to library    
OL,5,Cbudget                                 
OL,6,GA local authority has proposed cutting 
OL,7,Gits annual budget for libraries and    
OL,8,Gleisure centres by at least 20%.       
OL,10,FDurham County Council has suggested    
OL,11,Freducing its library and leisure       
OL,12,Fcentre budget by 26% and 20%           
OL,13,Frespectively in the 2028-29 financial  
OL,14,Fyear.                                  
OL,16,FIt said the plans were still at their  
OL,17,Fearliest stages and could not say      
OL,18,Fwhether the cuts would mean sites      
OL,19,Fbeing shut down or opening hours being 
OL,20,Fscaled back.                           
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
